WEBVTT

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:33.872
That's a little unusual, since I am
a Baptist minister, seminary-trained,

00:00:33.872 --> 00:00:38.226
and pastored a church for over 20 years,

00:00:38.226 --> 00:00:39.474
but it's true.

00:00:40.594 --> 00:00:43.264
It came as a part of my participation

00:00:43.264 --> 00:00:47.490
in a public safety
crime reduction strategy

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:51.247
that saw a 79 percent reduction
in violent crime

00:00:51.247 --> 00:00:54.525
over an eight-year period in a major city.

00:00:55.385 --> 00:00:57.242
But I didn't start out wanting to be


00:00:57.242 --> 00:01:00.585
a part of somebody's
crime reduction strategy.